### List all applications
GET http://localhost:3000/applications

### Create an application
POST http://localhost:3000/applications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Example Company",
  "roleTitle": "Node.js Developer",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/jobs/node-role",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "nextFollowUpAt": "2026-10-20T10:00:00.000Z",
  "notes": "Synthetic test data only.",
  "userId": 1
}

### Get one application (replace 1 with a real ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/applications/1

### Update an application (replace 1 with a real ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/applications/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "INTERVIEW",
  "notes": "Updated using a sample request."
}

### Delete an application (replace 1 with a real ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/applications/1
